Module tired "A long day on the moor" {
  Place moor "the moor" is wilderness.
  Place hollow "a hollow on the moor" is room within moor at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Company party "You" of 1 at hollow.
  Initially Set quantity(party, rations) to 3.
  Person boar "a boar" at hollow { Role "a boar rooting in the heather". Species boar. Peaceable. }
}
